  "constraints": [
    "History may move a candidate by at most one route level in this stage.",
    "Aspiration history only applies to the oral_aspiration_or_anaerobe family.",
    "In v3, a prior aspiration episode alone is context; a durable anatomic risk is required for aspiration Context-to-Priority.",
    "Aspiration Context-to-Priority also requires a top-three per-test rank or analytical reproducibility.",
    "Aspiration Audit-to-Context is limited to strict aspiration anaerobes with rank at most ten or reproducible signal, and at most two representatives per patient.",
